### ==============================================================================
### 1. Actuator & Documentation (Public Endpoints)
### ==============================================================================

### 1.1 Health Check (Verify if replica is UP)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### 1.2 OpenAPI Documentation (Swagger JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs


### ==============================================================================
### 2. Service-to-Service Contract: GET /internal/aircraft/{registration}
### Called by flight-operations-service to validate and book flights.
### Requires a token with role SERVICE.
### ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Query Available Aircraft (CS-TPA - A320neo) -> Should return 200 OK with specs
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/aircraft/CS-TPA
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}

### 2.2 Query Aircraft Under Maintenance (CS-TPM) -> Returns 200 OK (status: UNDER_MAINTENANCE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/aircraft/CS-TPM
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}

### 2.3 Query Unknown Aircraft (CS-XXX) -> Should return 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/aircraft/CS-XXX
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}

### 2.4 Access Denied without Service Token -> Returns 401 Unauthorized or 403 Forbidden
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/aircraft/CS-TPA

### 2.5 P2P Query Forwarding (CS-TPX partitioned on instance 2, requested via instance 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/aircraft/CS-TPX
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}

### 2.6 Loop Prevention (X-Forwarded-From stops forwarding loop when aircraft does not exist)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/aircraft/CS-UNKNOWN
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
X-Forwarded-From: instance2


### ==============================================================================
### 3. Aircraft Management API: /api/aircrafts
### Used by mechanics and fleet managers
### ==============================================================================

### 3.1 Query Aircraft with Mechanic Token (CS-TPB - 737 MAX)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/aircrafts/CS-TPB
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 3.2 Create New Aircraft (CS-NEW1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/aircrafts
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "registrationNumber": "CS-NEW1",
  "model": {
    "id": 1
  },
  "manufacturingDate": "2024-05-20",
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

### 3.3 Query Newly Created Aircraft
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/aircrafts/CS-NEW1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### ==============================================================================
### 4. Maintenance Templates API: /api/maintenance-templates
### ==============================================================================

### 4.1 List All Maintenance Templates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/maintenance-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 4.2 Get Maintenance Template by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/maintenance-templates/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### ==============================================================================
### 5. Maintenance Records & Reports: /api/maintenance-records
### ==============================================================================

### 5.1 List Ongoing Maintenance Records
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/maintenance-records/ongoing
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 5.2 Report: Total Maintenance Hours per Aircraft
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/maintenance-records/reports/total-hours
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 5.3 Report: Maintenance Cost per Aircraft
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/maintenance-records/reports/cost-per-aircraft
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

